{"turn_id": "d14-t1", "session_id": "d14", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "dataset_scope", "text": "HotelRec 是基于 TripAdvisor 的酒店推荐数据集，包含约 5000 万条评论。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-89f9839c13d2f99e19b625a3"}]}, {"key": "single_domain", "text": "作者称 HotelRec 是单一领域内规模最大的、带文本评论的公开推荐数据集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-89f9839c13d2f99e19b625a3"}]}, {"key": "no_region_mention", "text": "所提供的证据中没有说明这些酒店推荐是否限定于某个特定地区；证据仅描述了领域、规模、评论数量及评论随时间分布。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-e1e9a64f7c529e98a7f0fffc"}, {"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-89f9839c13d2f99e19b625a3"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d14-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d14-t2", "session_id": "d14", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "data_source_scope", "text": "HotelRec 是基于 TripAdvisor 的酒店评论构建的数据集，据作者所知是酒店领域最大的公开数据集，并被称为最大的单领域、带文本评论的推荐数据集。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-89f9839c13d2f99e19b625a3"}]}, {"key": "no_region_restriction_stated", "text": "所提供的证据段落中没有描述 HotelRec 被限制在某个特定地理区域；证据仅说明其评论来自 TripAdvisor。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-89f9839c13d2f99e19b625a3"}, {"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-f609376f2a770ee05eef9624"}]}, {"key": "size_and_time_span", "text": "HotelRec 包含 50,264,531 条来自 TripAdvisor 的酒店评论，时间跨度为十九年（2001 年 2 月 1 日至 2019 年 5 月 14 日）。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-e1e9a64f7c529e98a7f0fffc"}]}, {"key": "users_hotels_counts", "text": "HotelRec 共有 21,891,294 名用户和 365,056 家酒店。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-e1e9a64f7c529e98a7f0fffc"}]}, {"key": "review_content_fields", "text": "每条评论包含用户资料、酒店 URL、总体评分、摘要、用户撰写的文本、日期，以及在提供时的多个方面子评分。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-67c92985c297dc8704f31d5f"}]}, {"key": "future_multilingual", "text": "作者提出未来可以用其他语言扩充数据集并用于多语言推荐。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "2002.06854", "chunk_id": "c-67c92985c297dc8704f31d5f"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d14-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
